$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=frmdgambas  LOC_AFTER=?

* The base set of the free monoid on Gamma' is the set of words over Gamma'.

s1::eqid |- ( freeMnd ` Gamma' ) = ( freeMnd ` Gamma' )
s2::eqid |- ( Base ` ( freeMnd ` Gamma' ) ) = ( Base ` ( freeMnd ` Gamma' ) )
s3:s1,s2:frmdbas |- ( Gamma' e. _V -> ( Base ` ( freeMnd ` Gamma' ) ) = Word Gamma' )
s4::gammaex |- Gamma' e. _V
qed:s4,s3:ax-mp |- ( Base ` ( freeMnd ` Gamma' ) ) = Word Gamma'
